#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:27
#: 91753f928e5a4944a605c852eb0f28dc
msgid ""
"fa-py-libraries documents XRoboToolkit as “XRoboToolkit App + PC Service”"
" vs browser WebXR (`./run.sh vr` / `./run.sh vr-xrt`). It does not "
"publish store links or ADB steps for either Pico edition."
msgstr ""
"fa-py-libraries 将 XRoboToolkit 记为「XRoboToolkit App + PC Service」对比浏览器 "
"WebXR（`./run.sh vr` / `./run.sh vr-xrt`）。它不为任一 Pico 版本提供商店链接或 ADB 步骤。"

