#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:85
#: 42793048a8b7426aac441323eedbf6d4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Robot-side VR insertion is separate: set `enable_vr: true` in the "
"description’s `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` (most robots default "
"off). Same file: `vr_update_rate`, `vr_follow_frame`. Button map "
"(including WBC stop-one-arm vs VR pause) and follow-frame "
"troubleshooting: {ref}`stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands`."
msgstr ""
"机器人侧的 VR 接入是另一处：在描述包 `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 中设置 `enable_vr: "
"true`（多数机型默认关闭）。同一文件还有 `vr_update_rate`、`vr_follow_frame`。按键表（含 WBC 停单臂 vs "
"VR 停发指令）与跟随坐标系排查见 {ref}`stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:87
#: 2eeca36fa0ab4a44a2b4bf542cf975bc
msgid "Network Setup"
msgstr "网络设置"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:89
#: 2695529b209446338a2fcb99ffd5eaf2
msgid ""
"**Pico Enterprise:** USB shared networking (USB 网络共享) can put the headset"
" and PC on one network. Use the headset UI; no ADB steps here."
msgstr "**Pico 企业版：** USB 网络共享可将头显与电脑放在同一网络。使用头显界面；此处不写 ADB 步骤。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:90
#: 72d51eacec6e4ce98977359523a0dd59
msgid "**Pico consumer / Quest:** Wi-Fi (or other IP) only for this doc."
msgstr "**Pico 消费版 / Quest：** 本文仅记录 Wi-Fi（或其他 IP）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:92
#: 2abab6538f35444ab3cc075d29768a02
msgid ""
"If the VR device is on a different network: Zenoh or DDS discovery, "
"firewall, matching Domain IDs."
msgstr "若 VR 设备在不同网络：使用 Zenoh 或 DDS 发现、防火墙、匹配的 Domain ID。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:94
